vestments</h4><ul><li><a href=\"/about/investments/\"><span>Investments overview</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/current-projects/\"><span>Current projects</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/equities-and-properties/\"><span>Equities and properties</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/hotels/\"><span>Hotels</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/subsidiaries/\"><span>Subsidiaries</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/commercial-lending/\"><span>Commercial lending</span></a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Media</h4><ul><li><a href=\"/news/\"><span>News and media</span></a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Work with us</h4><ul><li><a href=\"/about/careers/\"><span>Careers</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/tenders-and-procurement/\"><span>Tenders and procurement</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/about/whistleblower/\"><span>Whistleblower</span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></li></ul></nav>\n\n    <div class=\"h-right\">\n      <div class=\"search\" id=\"siteSearch\">\n        <form class=\"s-field\" role=\"search\" action=\"/\" id=\"sForm\">\n          <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg>\n          <label for=\"q\" class=\"sr-only\">Search FNPF</label>\n          <input id=\"q\" name=\"s\" type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Search\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"suggest\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\">\n          <span class=\"kbd\">/</span>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"s-clear\" id=\"sClear\" aria-label=\"Clear search\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"><use href=\"#i-x\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n        <div class=\"suggest\" id=\"suggest\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Search suggestions\">\n          <div id=\"sgDefault\">\n            <p class=\"sg-label\">Popular</p>\n            <div class=\"chips\">\n              <a class=\"chip\" href=\"/withdrawals/education/\">Education withdrawal</a>\n              <a class=\"chip\" href