5</a></li><li><a href=\"/retirement/life-pension/\">Life Pension</a></li><li><a href=\"/retirement/term-annuity/\">Term Annuity</a></li><li><a href=\"/retirement/drawdown-account/\">DrawDown Account</a></li><li><a href=\"/retirement/pensioner-services/\">Pensioner services</a></li></ul></details><details><summary>Digital Services <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"/></svg></summary><ul><li><a href=\"/digital-services/myfnpf-app/\">myFNPF app</a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-services/online-portal/\">Online Portal</a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-services/myfund-sms/\">myFund *567#</a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-services/employer-portal/\">Employer Portal</a></li><li><a href=\"/digital-services/calculators/\">Calculators</a></li></ul></details><details><summary>Resources &amp; Help <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"/></svg></summary><ul><li><a href=\"/help/faqs/\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/contact/\">Contact us</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/offices/\">Offices</a></li><li><a href=\"/login/\">Log in</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/forms/\">Forms library</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/how-to-pay/\">How to pay</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/videos/\">Videos</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/member-newsletter/\">Member newsletter</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/fortnightly-articles/\">Fortnightly articles</a></li><li><a href=\"/help/reports/\">Reports</a></li></ul></details><details><summary>About FNPF <svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-chev\"/></svg></summary><ul><li><a href=\"/about/\">About us</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/our-history/\">Our history</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/our-people/\">Our people</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/governance/\">Governance</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/annual-reports/\">Annual reports</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/\">Investments overview</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/current-projects/\">Current projects</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/equities-and-properties/\">Equities and properties</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/hotels/\">Hotels</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/subsidiaries/\">Subsidiaries</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/investments/commercial-lending/\">Commercial lending</a></li><li><a href=\"/news/\">News and media</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/careers/\">Careers</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/tenders-and-procurement/\">Tenders and procurement</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/whistleblower/\">Whistleblower</a></li></ul></details></nav>\n    <div class=\"d-foot\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-dark\" href=\"https://myaccount.myfnpf.com.fj/ProMISMSS/wfmLoginExternal.aspx\">Member login</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"https://myaccount.myfnpf.com.fj/FnpfEmpPortal/\">Employer login</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<nav class=\"crumbs container\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/members/\">Members</a></li><li><a href=\"/withdrawals/\">Withdrawals</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Migration</li></ol></nav>\n<section class=\"phero with-img\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"phero-box\"><div class=\"phero-copy\"><p class=\"kicker\">Members</p><h1>Migration</h1><p class=\"phero-lead\">Moving overseas permanently? Withdraw your full balance once you hold an unconditional permanent residency visa.</p><div class=facts><div class=\"fact\"><span>Form</span><b>FW04</b></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>Payment</span><b>Lump sum</b></div></div><div class=\"chans\"><span>Apply via</span><i>FNPF office</i><i>Email</i></div></div><div class=\"ph-hero ph ph-fiji\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fiji\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pbody\"><div class=\"container pgrid\"><aside class=\"side\"><div class=\"side-box toc\"><p class=\"side-t\">On this page</p><ul id=\"tocList\"><li><a href=\"#fiji-citizens\">Fiji citizens</a></li><li><a href=\"#expatriate-workers\">Expatriate workers</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"side-box sforms\"><p class=\"side-t\">Forms</p><a href=\"https://myfnpf.com.fj/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/migrtion.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-doc\"/></svg><span>FW04 Migration Application</span></a></div><div class=\"side-box shelp\"><p class=\"side-t\">Need help?</p><a href=\"tel:+6793307811\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-call\"/></svg><span>330 7811 · 5857</span></a><a href=\"mailto:information@fnpf.com.fj\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-mail\"/></svg><span>information@fnpf.com.fj</span></a><a href=\"/help/offices/\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-pin\"/></svg><span>Find an office</span></a></div></aside><article class=\"prose\"><div class=\"tabs\">\n<div class=\"seg tab-seg\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"t651225-0\">Fiji citizens</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"t651225-1\">Expatriates</button></div>\n<div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"t651225-0\">\n<h2 id=\"fiji-citizens\">Fiji citizens</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You need an <strong>unconditional permanent residency visa</strong> (provisional visas don't qualify).</li>\n<li>Apply after your resignation date.</li>\n<li>Your full balance is paid as a lump sum. Anything credited later is paid as a <a href=\"/withdrawals/further-payments/\">further payment</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Documents:</strong> birth and marriage certificates; certified copies of passport pages; PR visa; Joint ID card; resignation letter if employed in the last 6 months; employment history; bank statement; overseas bank details.</p>\n<p>Paid to a local or overseas account, or by bank draft.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tab-panel\" data-panel=\"t651225-1\" hidden=\"hidden\">\n<h2 id=\"expatriate-workers\">Expatriate workers</h2>\n<p>Apply when your contract is completed or terminated, or you resign.</p>\n<p><strong>Documents:</strong> work permit; passport; resignation or contract completion letter; bank statement; overseas bank details.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"docs\"><a class=\"doc\" href=\"https://myfnpf.com.fj/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/migrtion.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"doc-ic\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-doc\"/></svg></span><span class=\"doc-t\">FW04: Migration Application<small>PDF</small></span><span class=\"doc-dl\"><svg class=\"ic\"><use href=\"#i-download\"/></svg></span></a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"related\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"h2 sm\">Related</h2><div class=\"rgrid\"><a class=\"rcard\" href=\"/withdrawals/further-payments/\"><b>Further payments</b><span>Contributions credited after a full withdrawal.</span><svg class=\"ic ar\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a><a class=\"rcard\" href=\"/members/rejoin-fnpf/\"><b>Re-join FNPF</b><span>Withdrew your savings for retirement or migration and now back at work? You can re-join FNPF.</span><svg class=\"ic ar\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a><a class=\"rcard\" href=\"/members/voluntary-membership/\"><b>Voluntary membership</b><span>For self-employed, informal and overseas workers aged 18 to 59.</span><svg class=\"ic ar\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"pfoot\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pfoot-box\"><div class=\"fb\" id=\"fb\"><p>Was this page helpful?</p><div class=\"fb-btns\"><button data-v=\"yes\">Yes</button><button data-v=\"no\">No</button></div><form class=\"fb-more\" hidden><label for=\"fbText\">How can we improve this page?</label><textarea id=\"fbText\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Please don't include personal details\"></textarea><button class=\"btn btn-dark\" type=\"submit\">Send feedback</button></form><p class=\"fb-thanks\" hidden>Thank you for your feedback.</p></div><p class=\"updated\">Last reviewed 6 November 2026</p></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"f-top\">\n      <div class=\"f-brand\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\"><img src=\"/assets/img/logo.png\" alt=\"FNPF\" width=\"59\" height=\"46\"><sp